---
title: "Runway loop"
note: "An endless show for H3 Motion Context: every clip, the last model turns and walks back in her look ($look~1) while the next one comes in wearing a new one ($look). Wire load_index and save_index into Load and Save Latent, then Run (Instant); rate the looks in the galaxy and the show learns your taste."
